#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Introduction to Qiskit and IBM Quantum {#introduction-to-qiskit-and-ibm-"
"quantum}"
msgstr ""
"Panimula sa Qiskit at IBM Quantum {#introduction-to-qiskit-and-ibm-quantum}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Welcome to the documentation for [Qiskit](/guides/tools-intro), its related "
"packages, and IBM Quantum&reg; Platform. This documentation includes how-to "
"guides to get you started on our tools, specific use-case tutorials that "
"include end-to-end examples, and a collection of API references.\n"
msgstr ""
"Maligayang pagdating sa dokumentasyon para sa [Qiskit](/guides/tools-intro),"
" ang mga nauugnay nitong pakete, at IBM Quantum&reg; Platform. Ang "
"dokumentasyong ito ay naglalaman ng mga praktikalng gabay upang "
"makapagsimula kayo sa aming mga tool, mga tutorial para sa mga partikular na"
" use case na may kasamang end-to-end na mga halimbawa, at isang koleksyon ng"
" mga API reference.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit provides a modular and extensible framework for quantum research and "
"development across algorithms, high-performance computing, and quantum "
"information science. With it, researchers can build, optimize, and execute "
"quantum workflows with [specialized addons](/guides/addons), software tools,"
" and extensive resources. Through IBM Quantum Platform, users can access "
"[quantum compute](/guides/compute-services) services, such as Qiskit Runtime"
" and the Qiskit Functions Catalog, to run workloads efficiently on the "
"IBM&reg; fleet of quantum computers.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang Qiskit ay nagbibigay ng modular at extensible na framework para sa "
"quantum research at development sa mga algorithm, high-performance "
"computing, at quantum information science. Gamit ito, maaaring bumuo, mag-"
"optimize, at magsagawa ang mga mananaliksik ng mga quantum workflow gamit "
"ang mga [specialized addons](/guides/addons), software tools, at malawak na "
"mga resources. Sa pamamagitan ng IBM Quantum Platform, maaaring ma-access ng"
" mga users ang mga [quantum compute](/guides/compute-services) services, "
"gaya ng Qiskit Runtime at Qiskit Functions Catalog, upang mabisang maisagawa"
" ang mga workload sa fleet ng mga quantum computer ng IBM&reg;.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![A graphic showing the different components of IBM Quantum Platform and "
"Qiskit.](/docs/images/guides/index/overview-image.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Isang graphic na nagpapakita ng iba't ibang components ng IBM Quantum "
"Platform at Qiskit.](/docs/images/guides/index/overview-image.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Beyond Qiskit and its related packages is the [Qiskit "
"ecosystem](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/ecosystem), a catalog of open-source "
"projects that interface with Qiskit to extend its functionality.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lampas sa Qiskit at sa mga nauugnay nitong pakete ay mayroon ang [Qiskit "
"ecosystem](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/ecosystem), isang catalog ng mga "
"open-source projects na nakikipag-ugnayan sa Qiskit upang palawakin ang "
"functionality nito.\n"

